---
// The Great Divorce city/county boundary figure. The article's markdown supplies
// the placeholder (`<div class="boundary-map" data-boundary-map></div>`) so the
// figure sits mid-article; this component only ships the script that mounts the
// map into it. [slug].astro includes it when the topic's body contains the
// placeholder, so other topics never load MapLibre.
---

<script>
  import { initBoundaryMap } from '../scripts/boundary-map'
  initBoundaryMap()
</script>
